er_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(l) Assistant Secretary for Veterans’ Employment and Training;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(l)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec1(l)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(m) Assistant Secretary for Disability Employment Policy;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(m)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec1(m)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(n) First assistants, pursuant to the Act, to the officials in the order \nlisted in (a) and (c)–(h);","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(n)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec1(n)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(o) Regional Solicitor—Dallas; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(o)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec1(o)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(p) Regional Administrator for the Office of the Assistant Secretary for \nAdministration and Management—Region VI/Dallas.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(p)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec1(p)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) No individual who is serving in an office listed \nin section 1(a)–(p) of this order in an acting capacity shall, by virtue of \nso serving, act as Secretary pursuant to this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) No individual listed in section 1(a)–(p) of this order shall act as \nSecretary unless that individual is otherwise eligible to so serve under \nthe Act.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Notwithstanding the provisions of this order, the President retains \ndiscretion, to the extent permitted by law, to depart from this order in \ndesignating an acting Secretary.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"81 FR 96329, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(c)","sha256":"35d2433568ae7a8196951a783d7b699edfd0e8d9ab118f98fbc1ff127654ebd4","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2016-12-30/pdf/2016-31792.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13755#sec2(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. Revocation. Executive Order 13245 of December 18, 2001 (Providing \nAn Order